#ASSERT `minutes a day of the parent's hour under the Women's Work Law` 4 TRUE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `minutes a day of absence while the spouse serves in reserve duty` 5 4 TRUE TRUE 0 EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `minutes a day of absence while the spouse serves in reserve duty` 5 4 TRUE TRUE 60 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `months of absence after the period under section 7(ד)(1) before the deduction` 40 6 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `months of absence after the period under section 7(ד)(1) before the deduction` 8 3.5 EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `weeks deducted from the absence under section 7(ד)(1)` 26 0 EQUALS 11
